    "parserSourceLimit": 4096,
    "buffer": "Separate namespace/name shadow lookup, tokens/prefixes/delimiters, operand evaluation, first/second loans, scalar capture and finalization. Result finalization separates each type, emission and temporary drop; final owning/property services are explicit pending children.",
    "view": "Advisory range cursor never publishes its copied lexer. Receiver capture precedes lower/upper evaluation. Token/type/scalar/endpoints and indexed result are separate children. Whole view/length/range/read effects have explicit service requests. Lexical roots authenticate before owner/name rows, one row per stage.",
    "copy": "37 stages preserve original result types, expected context, destination/empty root, one APPEND104 or APPEND_VIEW112, anonymous view close, success/error CFG, impossible mismatch trap, joins and reverse cleanup. Each original CFG/ownership action is an explicit child; whole CFG services are not billed as a single bounded internal action.",
    "continuations": "All inline and synchronously drained. Denied/waiting/completed advances do not publish/replay. Duplicate service/resume is rejected. No public Pending compiler or cross-invocation cache."
  },
